4. Summary Calculations

4.1 Total Failure Rates

Category Value
Σλ_total (Total FIT) 64.5 FIT
Σλ_SPF (Single-Point Failures) 0.265 FIT
Σλ_RF (Residual Failures) 0.508 FIT
Σλ_MF (Multiple-Point / Latent Failures) 1.26 FIT

4.2 Hardware Metrics

Metric Formula Calculated Value ASIL D Target Status
SPFM 1 − (Σλ_SPF / Σλ_total) 1 − (0.265 / 64.5) = 99.59% ≥ 99% ✅ PASS
LFM 1 − (Σλ_MF / (Σλ_total − Σλ_RF)) 1 − (1.26 / (64.5 − 0.508)) = 98.03% ≥ 90% ✅ PASS
PMHF Σλ_RF + Σλ_DPF (detected, not safe) ~0.75 FIT (estimated) ≤ 10 FIT ✅ PASS

4.3 PMHF Detailed Estimate

```
PMHF ≈ Σλ_RF + Σλ_DPF_safe
     ≈ 0.508 + 0.24
     ≈ 0.75 FIT
     
0.75 FIT < 10 FIT (ASIL D target) → ✅ PASS
```

